\]
Simplifying the expressions inside the parentheses:
\[
x + y = (2001^{1002} - 2001^{-1002}) + (2001^{1002} + 2001^{-1002}) = 2 \cdot 2001^{1002}
\]
\[
x - y = (2001^{1002} - 2001^{-1002}) - (2001^{1002} + 2001^{-1002}) = -2 \cdot 2001^{-1002}
\]
Now we can substitute these simplified expressions into the difference of squares formula:
\[
